{
    "comment": "확장 업데이트·설치 창 공용 진행·실패 안내(7.2.1).\n  ⑴ 진행 중(`_global.extUpdateBusy`): 「업데이트 중입니다 — 창을 닫지 마세요」와 시작 시각·경과(화면이 1초마다 계산 — startExtensionUpdateClock).\n  ⑵ 실패(`_global.extUpdateFailure` — 실패 응답의 data: outcome·warnings·retry_command): outcome 별로 지금 상태와 할 일을 알린다.\n     restored(되돌림됨)·restore_failed(되돌리기 실패 — 파일이 섞였을 수 있음)·kept_new(새 판이 남음)·unchanged(바뀐 것 없음).\n     필드가 없는 옛 서버 응답이면 이 절은 그려지지 않고, 창의 오류 상자(서버 문구)만 남는다.",
    "meta": {
        "is_partial": true,
        "description": "확장 업데이트 진행·실패 안내"
    },
    "id": "ext_update_status",
    "type": "basic",
    "name": "Div",
    "children": [
        {
            "id": "ext_update_progress",
            "type": "basic",
            "name": "Div",
            "if": "{{_global.extUpdateBusy === true}}",
            "props": {
                "className": "mb-3 p-3 bg-blue-50 dark:bg-blue-900/20 border border-blue-200 dark:border-blue-700 rounded-lg",
                "role": "status"
            },
            "children": [
                {
                    "type": "basic",
                    "name": "Div",
                    "props": {
                        "className": "flex-start gap-2"
                    },
                    "children": [
                        {
                            "type": "basic",
                            "name": "Icon",
                            "props": {
                                "name": "spinner",
                                "className": "spinner-sm text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 mt-0.5 shrink-0"
                            }
                        },
                        {
                            "type": "basic",
                            "name": "Div",
                            "props": {
                                "className": "flex-1"
                            },
                            "children": [
                                {
                                    "type": "basic",
                                    "name": "P",
                                    "props": {
                                        "className": "text-sm font-medium text-info-soft"
                                    },
                                    "text": "$t:admin.extension_update.progress_title"
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "ext_update_progress_clock",
                                    "type": "basic",
                                    "name": "P",
                                    "props": {
                                        "className": "text-xs text-info-soft mt-1"
                                    },
                                    "text": "$t:admin.extension_update.progress_clock|started={{_global.extUpdateStartedAt ?? ''}}|elapsed={{_global.extUpdateElapsed ?? '0:00'}}"
                                }
                            ]
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "id": "ext_update_failure",
            "type": "basic",
            "name": "Div",
            "if": "{{!!_global.extUpdateFailure && (!!_global.extUpdateFailure.outcome || (_global.extUpdateFailure.warnings ?? []).length > 0 || !!_global.extUpdateFailure.retry_command)}}",
            "props": {
                "className": "mb-3 p-3 bg-red-50 dark:bg-red-900/20 border border-red-200 dark:border-red-700 rounded-lg",
                "role": "alert"
            },
            "children": [
                {
                    "id": "ext_update_failure_restored",
                    "type": "basic",
                    "name": "P",
                    "if": "{{_global.extUpdateFailure?.outcome === 'restored'}}",
                    "props": {
                        "className": "text-sm text-error-soft"
                    },
                    "text": "$t:admin.extension_update.outcome_restored"
                },
                {
                    "id": "ext_update_failure_restore_failed",
                    "type": "basic",
                    "name": "Div",
                    "if": "{{_global.extUpdateFailure?.outcome === 'restore_failed'}}",
                    "children": [
                        {
                            "type": "basic",
                            "name": "P",
                            "props": {
                                "className": "text-sm font-medium text-error-soft"
                            },
                            "text": "$t:admin.extension_update.outcome_restore_failed"
                        },
                        {
                            "type": "basic",
                            "name": "P",
                            "props": {
                                "className": "text-xs text-error-soft mt-1"
                            },
                            "text": "$t:admin.extension_update.outcome_restore_failed_help"
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "id": "ext_update_failure_kept_new",
                    "type": "basic",
                    "name": "P",
                    "if": "{{_global.extUpdateFailure?.outcome === 'kept_new'}}",
                    "props": {
                        "className": "text-sm text-error-soft"
                    },
                    "text": "$t:admin.extension_update.outcome_kept_new"
                },
                {
                    "id": "ext_update_failure_unchanged",
                    "type": "basic",
                    "name": "P",
                    "if": "{{_global.extUpdateFailure?.outcome === 'unchanged'}}",
                    "props": {
                        "className": "text-sm text-error-soft"
                    },
                    "text": "$t:admin.extension_update.outcome_unchanged"
                },
                {
                    "id": "ext_update_failure_warnings",
                    "type": "basic",
                    "name": "Div",
                    "if": "{{(_global.extUpdateFailure?.warnings ?? []).length > 0}}",
                    "props": {
                        "className": "mt-2"
                    },
                    "children": [
                        {
                            "type": "basic",
                            "name": "P",
                            "props": {
                                "className": "text-xs font-medium text-warning-soft"
                            },
                            "text": "$t:admin.extension_update.warnings_title"
                        },
                        {
                            "type": "basic",
                            "name": "Ul",
                            "props": {
                                "className": "mt-1 space-y-0.5"
                            },
                            "children": [
                                {
                                    "type": "basic",
                                    "name": "Li",
                                    "iteration": {
                                        "source": "_global.extUpdateFailure.warnings ?? []",
                                        "item_var": "failWarning"
                                    },
                                    "props": {
                                        "className": "text-xs text-warning-soft break-all"
                                    },
                                    "text": "• {{typeof failWarning === 'string' ? failWarning : [failWarning.step, failWarning.target_name ?? failWarning.target, failWarning.reason ?? failWarning.message].filter(Boolean).join(' · ')}}"
                                }
                            ]
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "id": "ext_update_failure_retry",
                    "type": "basic",
                    "name": "Div",
                    "if": "{{!!_global.extUpdateFailure?.retry_command}}",
                    "props": {
                        "className": "mt-2"
                    },
                    "children": [
                        {
                            "type": "basic",
                            "name": "P",
                            "props": {
                                "className": "text-xs text-secondary"
                            },
                            "text": "$t:admin.extension_update.retry_command_hint"
                        },
                        {
                            "type": "basic",
                            "name": "Pre",
                            "props": {
                                "className": "mt-1 rounded bg-gray-900 dark:bg-gray-950 text-gray-100 dark:text-gray-200 text-xs p-2 whitespace-pre-wrap break-all"
                            },
                            "text": "{{_global.extUpdateFailure?.retry_command}}"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        }
    ]
}
